We reach my building.
It is raining heavily outside.
Rohan, Priya, and I come into the inside corridor.
Just then, my neighbor Asha comes out of her flat.
Her dog Moti is also with her.
Moti sees me and comes close happily.
Asha looks at me, smiles and says, "Maya, wish you a very happy birthday!"
She gives me a beautiful box of local sweets.
"I have brought these sweets specially for you," Asha tells me.
"I bought it from the shop just this morning," she says further.
I thank her happily.
Then I introduce Rohan and Priya to Asha.
"They have come with me from the office," I tell her.
"We cut a cake in the office in the afternoon," Rohan tells Asha.
Asha says namaste to them.
I invite Asha and Moti to my home.
"You come inside with us too," I say to her.
"Let's all eat your sweets together."
Asha says yes and we all go into my flat.
